``` // Геттеры и сеттеры для keyPart1 и keyPart2 @Override ```java public boolean equals(Object o) { ``` if (this == o) return true; if (o == null || getClass() != o.getClass()) return false; MyCompositeKey that = (MyCompositeKey) o; return Objects.equals(keyPart1, that.keyPart1) && Objects.equals(keyPart2, that.keyPart2); ```java

